  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧應用與數據科學導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO INTELLIGENT APPLICATIONS AND DATA SCIENCE",
    "describe_ch": "人工智慧與數據分析在各行各業的需求及應用快速湧現，在方便我們生活的同時也衍生許多資訊安全威脅。除了認識這些資訊科技技術，也要能概述其基礎知識、發展趨勢及潛在風險，進而善用到生活與學習上。學習使用電腦軟體（如Excel、Jupyter等）進行低代碼/無代碼開發，並以小組討論及製作小專題加強綜合運用能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The needs and applications of artificial intelligence (AI) and data analysis are springing up in all walks of life, where these applications greatly facilitate people’s lives but bring some threats of information security. In addition to understand these information technologies, students are also able to summarize their basic knowledge, development trends and potential risks, and moreover, make good use of technologies to life and learning. Learn to use computer software tools, e.g., Excel and Jupyter, for developing applications with Low-Code / No-Code, and promote overall ability by group discussions and small projects.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
